=== launch click manually for lb1 (mirrors click_wrapper) ===
=== run as root, no sudo, capture stderr in foreground first ===
$ timeout 2 click /opt/pox/ext/lb1.click 2>/tmp/diag-click-launch/lb1.fg.stderr; echo rc=$?
rc=132
  stderr> bash: line 1:  4290 Illegal instruction     timeout 2 click /opt/pox/ext/lb1.click 2> /tmp/diag-click-launch/lb1.fg.stderr
--- /tmp/diag-click-launch/lb1.fg.stderr ---
$ head -80 /tmp/diag-click-launch/lb1.fg.stderr
timeout: the monitored command dumped core

